### Requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension. Click "Send Request" above each one.
### The tokens are captured by the three logins below: no copy and paste.
###
### Seed accounts (password = SEED_PASSWORD, "Cristal2026" by default):
###   ana.torres (employee) · marisol.garcia (manager of Cumbres) · direccion (director)
### The ids are the ones `python -m scripts.seed` leaves in a new database:
###   daycare 1 = Cumbres · rooms 1 Lactantes, 2 Maternal A, 3 Maternal B, 4 Preescolar
###   shifts 1 matutino, 2 vespertino · users 3 ana.torres ... 9 maria.lopez · position 5 Auxiliar · termination reason 1 Renuncia
###
### The interactive documentation (with a "Try it out" button) is at {{base}}/docs when ENVIRONMENT=development.
### To use Postman: Import -> Link -> {{base}}/openapi.json

@base = http://localhost:8000
@password = Cristal2026
@day = 2026-11-05

### ═══════════════ Session ═══════════════

### Is it alive?
GET {{base}}/

### Login as an employee
# @name loginEmployee
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "ana.torres", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Login as a manager
# @name loginManager
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "marisol.garcia", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Login as the director
# @name loginDirector
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "direccion", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@employee = {{loginEmployee.response.body.token}}
@manager = {{loginManager.response.body.token}}
@director = {{loginDirector.response.body.token}}

### My profile
GET {{base}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{employee}}

### Change my password -> 200 (and 400 with "missing" if it is weak)
PUT {{base}}/profile/password
Authorization: Bearer {{employee}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "{{password}}", "newPassword": "Cristal2027" }

### Catalogs for the menus: roles, positions, shifts, termination reasons, absence reasons
GET {{base}}/catalogs
Authorization: Bearer {{employee}}

### ═══════════════ Employee ═══════════════

### "Clock in" screen: am I inside? what is my shift today? where is the daycare?
GET {{base}}/time-records/status
Authorization: Bearer {{employee}}

### Clock in (room and shift come from my schedule). 201, or 200 if the uuid was already saved.
### occurredAt is optional: an offline clock-in that arrives later. Without UTC offset it is read in the daycares' time zone.
POST {{base}}/time-records/clock-in
Authorization: Bearer {{employee}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uuid": "5f1c3d2a-7b1e-4c55-9a77-0a1b2c3d4e5f",
  "occurredAt": "{{day}}T07:20:00",
  "latitude": 25.7447,
  "longitude": -100.4036
}

### Clock out
POST {{base}}/time-records/clock-out
Authorization: Bearer {{employee}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "occurredAt": "{{day}}T15:00:00" }

### My records
GET {{base}}/time-records?startDate={{day}}&endDate={{day}}
Authorization: Bearer {{employee}}

### My attendance (summary and days)
GET {{base}}/attendance/me?startDate=2026-11-02&endDate=2026-11-08
Authorization: Bearer {{employee}}

### My schedule
GET {{base}}/schedules/me
Authorization: Bearer {{employee}}

### Notices that reached me
GET {{base}}/notices/inbox
Authorization: Bearer {{employee}}

### Confirm I read notice 1
POST {{base}}/notices/1/read
Authorization: Bearer {{employee}}

### ═══════════════ Manager ═══════════════

### Staff of my daycare (?active=false for terminated, ?active=all for both)
GET {{base}}/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### One person: profile, today's schedule and history of movements
GET {{base}}/staff/3
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### Hire an employee -> 201 with temporaryPassword (shown only once)
POST {{base}}/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nueva Persona",
  "username": "nueva.persona",
  "email": "nueva.persona@sonrisascristal.mx",
  "phone": "81 1000 0100",
  "positionId": 5
}

### Update a person
PUT {{base}}/staff/10
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "81 1000 0101" }

### Reset a password -> { "temporaryPassword": "..." }
POST {{base}}/staff/10/password
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### Terminate (the person is not deleted: it stays in the history)
POST {{base}}/staff/10/terminate
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "terminationReasonId": 1, "notes": "Moved to another city" }

### Movements (hires, terminations, transfers). Filters: type, startDate, endDate
GET {{base}}/movements?type=hire
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### Rooms and minimums
GET {{base}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### New room
POST {{base}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sala de arte", "minStaff": 2 }

### Change the minimum of a room
PUT {{base}}/rooms/1
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "minStaff": 3 }

### Schedules of the daycare on a date
GET {{base}}/schedules?date={{day}}
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### Replace the schedule of person 3 from a date (days not listed are days off)
PUT {{base}}/schedules/3
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "validFrom": "2026-11-16",
  "days": [
    { "day": "monday", "shiftId": 1, "roomId": 2 },
    { "day": "tuesday", "shiftId": 1, "roomId": 2 },
    { "day": "wednesday", "shiftId": 2, "roomId": 2 }
  ]
}

### Clock in several people at once -> 201 { recorded, skipped }
POST {{base}}/time-records/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userIds": [3, 4, 5], "occurredAt": "{{day}}T07:00:00" }

### Records of the daycare, only the ones outside the zone
GET {{base}}/time-records?startDate={{day}}&endDate={{day}}&withinZone=false
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### Fix a record directly. "clockOutAt": null removes the clock-out.
PUT {{base}}/time-records/1
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "clockInAt": "{{day}}T07:00:00" }

### Attendance of the daycare in a period
GET {{base}}/attendance?startDate=2026-11-02&endDate=2026-11-08
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### Attendance of one person
GET {{base}}/attendance/3?startDate=2026-11-02&endDate=2026-11-08
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### Mark an absence (absent and incident need a reason: absenceReasonId or absenceReason). 201, or 200 if it corrected one.
POST {{base}}/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 4, "date": "{{day}}", "status": "absent", "absenceReason": "enfermedad" }

### Correct an attendance row
PUT {{base}}/attendance/1
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "present" }

### Send a notice. target: all | shift (shiftId) | room (roomId) | people (userIds)
POST {{base}}/notices
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Reunión de padres",
  "message": "El viernes a las 3 pm en el patio.",
  "noticeType": "meeting",
  "target": "all",
  "requiresConfirmation": true
}

### Notices of my daycare, with "9 of 14 confirmed"
GET {{base}}/notices
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### Who confirmed and who is pending
GET {{base}}/notices/1
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### Coverage of my daycare (staff present against the minimum of each room and shift)
GET {{base}}/coverage?date={{day}}
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### Statistics of the month
GET {{base}}/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### Attendance as a CSV file
GET {{base}}/export/attendance?startDate=2026-11-01&endDate=2026-11-08
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### ═══════════════ Director ═══════════════

### All the staff, or one daycare with ?daycareId=
GET {{base}}/staff?daycareId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{director}}

### Create a manager in another daycare
POST {{base}}/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{director}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nueva Responsable",
  "username": "nueva.responsable",
  "email": "nueva.responsable@sonrisascristal.mx",
  "phone": "81 1000 0200",
  "positionId": 2,
  "role": "manager",
  "daycareId": 2
}

### Change a role
PUT {{base}}/staff/3
Authorization: Bearer {{director}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "manager" }

### Transfer a person to another daycare
POST {{base}}/staff/4/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{director}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "daycareId": 2, "notes": "Closer to home" }

### Daycares
GET {{base}}/daycares
Authorization: Bearer {{director}}

### New daycare (radiusMeters = the circle that counts as "inside")
POST {{base}}/daycares
Authorization: Bearer {{director}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Santa Catarina", "latitude": 25.6733, "longitude": -100.4583, "radiusMeters": 150 }

### Change a daycare
PUT {{base}}/daycares/1
Authorization: Bearer {{director}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "radiusMeters": 200 }

### New catalog entries
POST {{base}}/catalogs/positions
Authorization: Bearer {{director}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Psicóloga" }

###
POST {{base}}/catalogs/termination-reasons
Authorization: Bearer {{director}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Jubilación" }

###
POST {{base}}/catalogs/absence-reasons
Authorization: Bearer {{director}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "duelo" }

### Change the hours of a shift
PUT {{base}}/catalogs/shifts/2
Authorization: Bearer {{director}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startTime": "12:00", "endTime": "20:00" }

### Summary of every daycare on a date: which are complete and which are short
GET {{base}}/summary?date={{day}}
Authorization: Bearer {{director}}

### A general notice for every daycare (no daycareId) or for one (daycareId)
POST {{base}}/notices
Authorization: Bearer {{director}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "subject": "Día inhábil", "message": "El lunes no hay servicio.", "noticeType": "reminder" }

### Who changed what (the database triggers fill it). Filters: table, recordId, userId
GET {{base}}/audit?table=asistencia
Authorization: Bearer {{director}}

### ═══════════════ Prometheus ═══════════════

### Metrics (METRICS_TOKEN from the .env)
GET {{base}}/metrics
Authorization: Bearer change-this-to-another-secret-text
